                "text": "When it comes to water, we must make science-backed decisions that protects human health and the environment. Today, I joined 167 Congressional Democrats to defend clean water ahead of a Supreme Court case that seeks to disregard the science and narrow clean water protections. https://t.co/f0XdYl8Atp",
