                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This morning, the Supreme Court decimated the constitutional right to abortion in its decision on Mississippi Dobbs v. Jackson Women\u2019s Health Organization. This is a devastating decision that undermines our representative democracy and the legitimacy of the Supreme Court.",
