                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Senate should waste no time and pass the Women\u2019s Health Protection Act, which would codify the right to choose into federal law, and the Ensuring Access to Abortion Act, which would safeguard a women\u2019s right to travel to another state to access reproductive health care.",
